# UniSafe Environment Configuration

# TomTom Traffic API Key (Used for real-time Live Traffic Flow overlays on the Women's Safety Map)
# 1. Sign up for a free developer account at: https://developer.tomtom.com
# 2. Copy your Consumer API Key from the TomTom Developer Dashboard.
# 3. Run Flutter with this key:
#    flutter run --dart-define=TOMTOM_API_KEY=your_tomtom_api_key_here
#
# Alternatively, you can tap "Live Traffic" directly on the Women's Safety map in the app
# and paste your key into the secure in-app setup dialog.
TOMTOM_API_KEY=your_tomtom_api_key_here
